  "description_en": "Generates contract review results by calling a large language model. The model returns review results, risk items, and suggested modifications for the contract. Specify the contract file ID, review stance, and review rules. The review results are returned incrementally through Server-Sent Events (SSE)",
  "description_zh": "该接口用于合同审查模块的审查结果生成，调用大模型返回合同的审查结果、审查风险项、建议修改内容等。传入合同审查文件的ID、审查立场、审查规则，会通过sse的方式增量式返回模型生成的审查结果",
